# Working copy for local authz (gitignored). Prefer the installer:
#
#   npx @lumi-ai-lab/harness-data install --auth-blob 'qdm1enc...'
#
# The installer writes the supplied encrypted blob atomically with mode 0600.
#
# Production should distribute an encrypted Blob via HARNESS_AUTH_BLOB_FILE (keep allow_local_blob: true).
# A legacy HARNESS_AUTH_USER_ID, if present, is host metadata only and is not a qdm authorization input.
# Do not commit config/dev-auth.blob (gitignored).
